  "description": "3D Car Run is a Western desert racing game. Tear down dusty Route 66 highways, red-rock canyons, ghost towns and train yards: swipe left or right to switch lanes, up to jump over barricades, down to dive under beams. Grab gold coins, Sheriff Guard, Gold Magnet and Dust Storm Nitro, chase the Gold Rush bonus run and climb the weekly ranks.",
